\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  Oh Lord our God let it be well,\cf0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 As I begin this day's business;
\par When I decide to end it all,
\par I look up only to my God,
\par Let all be well.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  When I'm engaged for duty sake,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Thy blessing do I always need.
\par So I have to humble myself,
\par I beseech Thee Oh my Lord that,
\par Let all be well.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.  Not my hardwork or my good thoughts,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 My diligence and my knowledge;
\par  That will make all end well for me,
\par    Thou Lord I always beseech Thee,
\par Let all be well.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4.  Without Thee my Lord, I cannot,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Accomplish any task alone.
\par  All our progress depend on Thee
\par  That's why I always look to Thee,
\par  Let all be well.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  5.  Thy grace is abundant for me,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  Therefore accept my gratitude.
\par  I'll cast my net for Thy Word's sake,
\par  I'll hold fast, never discouraged,
\par  Let all be well.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6.   I commit myself and my work,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  Under Thy Divine surveillance.
\par  Thou knowest what is best for me,
\par  What Thou givest, I do accept
\par  Let all be well.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7.   Should there be trouble threatening me,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  Thou wilt not leave me in despair.
\par  Thou support me and defend me,
\par  Thou wilt cause my pains to depart,
\par  Let it end well.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 8\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 8.  I do rely fully on Thee;
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Thy Father's love wilt keep me safe,
\par Thou redeem me from my distress,
\par Thou wilt not leave me in bondage,
\par Let it end well.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 9\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 9. Bless me from now until the time
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 I come to the end of my task.
\par Help me today and ever more,
\par When my journey comes to its end,
\par \pard    Let it end well.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

